OL,3,ACocaine overtakes heroin as leading
OL,4,Acause of drug deaths in England and
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of deaths from cocaine use
OL,8,Fin England and Wales has nearly
OL,9,Fquadrupled in a decade, overtaking
OL,10,Fthose attributed to heroin for the
OL,11,Ffirst time.
OL,13,FCocaine was linked to more than one in
OL,14,Ffive drug poisoning deaths registered
OL,15,Fin 2025, more than any other single
OL,16,Fsubstance, with charities blaming its
OL,17,Fincreased purity and availability.
OL,19,FMeanwhile a record 115 ketamine-linked
OL,20,Fdeaths were registered, almost twice as
OL,21,Fmany as in 2024, according to Office
OL,22,Ffor National Statistics data.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
