OL,3,ACocaine overtakes heroin as leading
OL,4,Acause of drug deaths in England and
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe overall rate of drug deaths fell
OL,8,Ffor the first time since 2012. But
OL,9,Fexperts pointed out regional inequality
OL,10,Fwas growing, with the rate of such
OL,11,Fdeaths more than twice as high in the
OL,12,FNorth East as in London.
